{"repositoryId":1202115967,"availability":"available","full":"Gudbjerg/POWER-TRADER-PORTFOLIO","name":"POWER-TRADER-PORTFOLIO","description":"Five-layer quantitative analytics platform for European gas and power markets. Covers cointegration scanning, forward curve PCA (TTF M+1 to M+18), Nordic price decomposition, ML regime detection (LSTM/HMM/FinBERT), VaR simulation, and BESS project finance. 31 modules, 9 live data sources.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-05T16:08:36Z","updated":"2026-10-13T21:52:01Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/TobGud/power-trader-portfolio","topics":["bess","cointegration","energy-economics","energy-trading","entso-e","gas-markets","machine-learning","market-analytics","nord-pool","portfolio","power-markets","python","quantitative-finance","streamlit","time-series"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/TobGud/power-trader-portfolio","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:30.104Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:30.104Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:30.104Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T02:49:30.104Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A five-layer quantitative analytics platform built to mirror the analytical workflow of a European physical energy trader.","The platform integrates live fundamental data from ENTSO-E Transparency, GIE AGSI+/ALSI, Nord Pool, and ICE/Yahoo Finance into a unified analytical environment covering storage balances, forward curve dynamics, cross-commodity price transmission, machine learning regime detection, portfolio risk simulation, and battery storage project economics. All models are implemented from scratch in Python; no third-party signal providers or data vendors are used beyond the public API layer. The architecture escalates from raw market observation in Layer 1 to actionable composite signals in Layer 5,…"],"f